* ACTIVE-power candidate bench: wire_r002w02 (EXPERIMENT VARIANT, not the committed design).
* Same bench shape as tb/active_osc_wire.spice; the variant subckt differs from
* design/osc_bank/osc_wire.spice by exactly the lever recorded in the iteration record.
.options rshunt=1e12
.include "cand/wire_r002w02.spice"
Vdd vdd 0 1.8
Vss vss 0 0
Ben en 0 V='v(vdd)*min(max((time-1n)/100p,0),1)'
Xdut en out vdd vss osc_wire_r002w02
